    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Well Located 3 Bed End of Terrace Residence With Huge Potential \n\nLocated on Wexford Street, New Ross, the sale of number 11 offers buyers an excellent opportunity to acquire an exceptionally well located end of terrace property and create a wonderful home in this established residential area of town. Extending to approximately 75 sq. m, the property offers flexible living accommodation comprising an entrance hall, sitting room, living room, dining room, kitchen and shower room on the ground floor. On the first floor, there are three bedrooms. Outside, there is a secure and sheltered rear yard with a useful storage shed. While requiring modernisation number 11 presents a superb blank canvas for anyone seeking a characterful home within walking distance of the town centre and its wide range of shops, schools and leisure facilities. Early viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Porch 1.9m x 0.9m\nSittingroom 3.8m x 3.7m with open fire\nLivingroom 4.6m x 2.55 with open fire\nDining room 4.4m x 2.4m \nKitchen 4m x 2.1m with range of fitted units\nShower room 2.3m x 1.7m\nFirst Floor\nBedroom 1. 3.6m x 3.1m \nBedroom 2. 2.5m x 2.3m\nBedroom 3. 2.5m x 2.2m\n \nOUTSIDE: Enclosed rear yard, storage shed/ boiler house \nSERVICES: All main services and O.F.C.H.\nBER: E2 No 112378039\nEIRCODE: Y34K125\nVIEWING: By prior appointment\n\n"
